SPAN SURVIVAL ANALYSIS
DEMO DATA: these numbers are made up and do not come from your repositories.
How much of the code AI writes is still there later, and why the rest disappears.
A span is a stretch of bytes an AI wrote.

01 HOW MUCH SURVIVES
Of the bytes AI wrote, the share still in the code after 24 hours, 7 days and 30 days. Each age counts only code that old.

  AI bytes written   2.4 MB   (1,284 spans)
  Still there now    61%   (all ages)

  from        age    spans  surviving    written  retention
  commit      24h    1,284  2,063,597  2,516,582      82.0%
  commit      7d       902  1,159,000  1,900,000      61.0%
  commit      30d      417    396,000    900,000      44.0%
  generation  24h    1,310  1,879,600  2,540,000      74.0%
  generation  7d       930    975,000  1,950,000      50.0%
  generation  30d      430    285,200    920,000      31.0%

